cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VisualProof, please cite it as below."
title: "VisualProof"
abstract: >-
  A web tool that shows a Lean codebase's declaration graph and the trusted computing base (TCB)
  of its theorems: the definitions a statement rests on and the axioms behind its proof. People
  and AI agents review a formalization together on it, and it keeps the record of that review.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Xu
    given-names: Yingte
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9071-7862"
repository-code: "https://github.com/LucianoXu/VisualProof"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.8.2"
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formal verification
  - interactive theorem proving
  - trusted computing base
  - proof review
